            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[When you write a question beside an AI reply and point at one part of it with an arrow, an underline or a circle, Margin now asks about exactly that part. Before, a question written between two rows of a list could be sent with the neighbouring row instead. If your marks reach two rows, both are sent together rather than one being guessed. Includes everything in build 190.
]]></description>
